{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110346","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110346/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110346/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110346/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110346","id":3397799789,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7Khk9t","number":110346,"title":"`get_global_mouse_position()` does not work outside of window in wayland","user":{"login":"CatMeowByte","id":136966673,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCnyEQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136966673?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatMeowByte","html_url":"https://github.com/CatMeowByte","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatMeowByte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatMeowByte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatMeowByte/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatMeowByte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatMeowByte/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatMeowByte/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatMeowByte/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatMeowByte/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CatMeowByte/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-09-09T10:31:45Z","updated_at":"2025-09-10T09:17:09Z","closed_at":"2025-09-10T09:17:06Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.stable.official [4c311cbee]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Fedora Linux 42 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - zink Vulkan 1.4(NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVK GA102) (MESA_NVK)) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600X 6-Core Processor (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\n`Node2D.get_global_mouse_position()` doesnt return the mouse position outside of the window while using wayland, whereas when the configuration `run/platforms/linuxbsd/prefer_wayland` is disabled the coordinate update reliably outside of window can return negative value, even when unfocused. wayland also slower in updating the value.\n\ni assume this is related to the wayland promised security to restrict global access to mouse pointer event.\n\nwithout this making an eye app (like the classic _xeyes_) that can look at mouse position would be more difficult if not impossible to implement.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n\nfunc _process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tvar position: Vector2 = get_global_mouse_position()\n\tprint(position)\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://